                                                "sense_id": "a54955a2-02b3-32cb-b4f0-595fe2b85dcd",
                                                "text": "During the construction of the viaduct, the sinking of the caissons in the river bed caused much difficulty to the engineer and contractors, as a bed of running sand was encountered; in consequence, the expenditure for these foundations proved almost prohibitive."
                                            }
